    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00357",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "男人听了可能会生气，不过，心里一定会很高兴的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "A man might get angry when he hears it, but deep down he is sure to be very pleased.",
          "g": "predicate"
