      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00357",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "母亲用手按着额头，又说，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her mother pressed a hand to her forehead and went on,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p00357",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "“我坐在你爹的桌前，就想你爹的事。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "When I sit at your father's desk, I think about your father.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
